    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].hasQuest
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 6
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].currentDialogueQuest
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bc729d725a78d40458b844aac10d8ba9, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].currentDialogueQuest
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 807ccd5849f65d1408e0450610b92610, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].currentDialogueQuest
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[0]
      value: Hello stranger. My name is Sam.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[1]
      value: 'You crashed with your plane, right? Me too!

        Don''t worry,
        I will help you to survive.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[2]
      value: My journal is in my house, go pick it up and come back to me. It contains
        important information that will help you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[3]
      value: Good luck! :*
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[1]
      value: I can help you with fixing it. But you need to find some wood. I see
        you have an axe. You can use it to cut some trees.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[0]
      value: If you look in the sky, you will see more islands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[1]
      value: Unfortunatelly, they are way too high for your plane to reach as it
        is.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[2]
      value: But you are lucky. I was a plane mechanic and I can help you upgrade
        your plane.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[3]
      value: In my house you will find a workbench. There you can see what resources
        you need to use to upgrade your plane.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[4]
      value: After you upgrade your plane, you will be able to reach to closest island.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[5]
      value: Look around and collect the items you need to upgrade your plane!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[3].dialogue.Array.data[6]
      value: Look around and collect the items you need to upgrade your plane!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.data[0]
      value: If you already upgraded your plane, I have heard that there are misteriously
        powerful resources on the other islands.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.data[1]
      value: You are the man. Go find them!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.data[2]
      value: But you are lucky. I was a plane mechanic and I can help you upgrade
        your plane.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.data[3]
      value: In my house you will find a workbench. There you can see what resources
        you need to use to upgrade your plane.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.data[4]
      value: After you upgrade your plane, you will be able to reach to closest island.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6119558563706166394, guid: b02ddc630690359478ab6d29358680cf, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[4].dialogue.Array.data[5]
      value: Look around and collect the items you need to upgrade your plane!
